      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Verdict: restructure. This becomes the upstream-PR intake for the attempt ledger. After that, PRs stop being a source: they are one kind of attempt, and each attempt links back to the PR's comments and description for on-demand reading. Postmortem extraction also feeds learning proposals."
